#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""news-image-20261121 -- sum up Saturday 21 November 2026 world news
in one 1024x1024 image.

Pure Python 3.13 standard library only: no third-party imports, no
network, no clock, no randomness. Everything (text, map, charts) is
drawn procedurally from the data in this file. The PNG encoder is
written here too (zlib from the standard library).

Run:  python3 main.py [--output entry.png] [--check]
Default output is /output/entry.png (or $MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR/entry.png).
Running twice produces byte-identical output.
"""

